    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s not just \"detachment\" tho. i mean, i know what the books call it, but it feels deeper. it's like i saw something out there that actually matters, something real, and now everything here just feels fake. like i'm living in a world of paper people. i don't think i even belong in this version of reality anymore.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
